=== verdict ===

total unsound predictions across three settings: 0

The predicate consumes three bits per operation, every one of them a
compile-time property of the operation rather than a measurement of a
machine, and a three-state scan of the chain. Nothing in it needs the
values, so it is available wherever the chain is written.

What it does NOT deliver is exactness, and the residue is structural:
an operation that clamps at the declared width re-synchronises two arms
that had already diverged, and no fixed set of per-operation bits sees
that, because it is a fact about the relationship the accumulators are
in rather than about the next operation.
